WEBVTT

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:11.608
Choose Upload in the side menu.

00:00:11.858 --> 00:00:17.858
Click Choose videos.

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:33.172
Choose a file from your computer.

00:00:33.422 --> 00:00:38.620
Wait until you see Uploaded just now.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:44.202
Click Edit details for demo-lesson.mp4.

00:00:44.452 --> 00:00:50.452
Type "Learn how to save money on
mobile data." in the Description box.

00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:56.287
Tick Life Skills.

00:00:56.537 --> 00:01:01.951
Select G from the Maturity rating list.

00:01:02.201 --> 00:01:06.051
Click Save changes.

00:01:06.301 --> 00:01:11.435
Wait until you see Changes saved.

00:01:11.685 --> 00:01:17.685
Check that Before you publish
shows what is left to do.

00:01:19.539 --> 00:01:23.399
Click Choose poster.

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:29.649
Check that Save poster is on the screen.
